PLUjG_1HCzMnVj0Swig40I_RNHSn-JBfTeI5lb8MZNYjKsIcr09bApJVli6L4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQfDEbNvhNr41GQqMG-aRCEQWVNVJY0jIsbGshhI6c5bA&oe=6AFF001F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoPreview_2560x1440_v2.png", "id": "951309774028294", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673645340_951309777361627_7758813051711564787_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Cd5vWJzG8nQQ7kNvwEi_OYp&_nc_oc=AdpoZNjUiPz3fztHViq5hC_4KMzvBe3njLU6jcuuelhWAKPFHKFTeD0w2Ra76B-3_UI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRXWSZ4t6ARaPAW6vR56jTyUpOqtPjN4YVvIacL_TzZiw&oe=6AFF2481"}, "display_name": "MiniSphere: Panoramic Image Viewer", "keywords": ["PanoramaViewer", "VRImageViewer", "360ImageViewer"], "long_description": "\u2022 Designed for intuitive 360\u00b0 panoramic image viewing presentations, including first-time headset users\n\n\u2022 Local image loading from the Download (Quest 3 > Internal shared storage > Download) folder \u2014 images can be downloaded directly through the Quest browser or transferred via USB connection \n\n\u2022 Supports up to 7 panoramic images.\n\n\u2022 Filename-based image sorting \u2014 rename your images to create your preferred viewing sequence. Recommended format: 01_Filename, 02_Filename, 03_Filename.\n\n\u2022 Controller-free navigation using hand tracking\n A. Turn VR mode on and off using press-and-hold buttons\n B. Navigate to previous and next scenes using left and right hand-interactable buttons\n", "short_description": "A simple panoramic image viewer that accesses the local Download folder (Quest 3 > Internal shared storage > Download) and loads compatible images. Users can turn VR mode on and off and move to the next or previous scene using hand-interactable buttons, completely controller-free."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/